  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-28T18:21:11.376Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently the perf ranking for skinned meshes on PC is:\nExcellent: 1\nGood: 2\nMedium: 8\nPoor: 16\nThis is a weird scale and also not actually reflective of real VRChat avatar performance!\nAs is well known by now, avatars with lots of blend shapes on one area of the mesh (i.e. the face) should split the blendshape-heavy area from the rest of the mesh.\nIt would thus make more sense for PC performance rankings to be:\nExcellent: 2\nGood: 4\nMedium: 8\nPoor: 16\nThese numbers make more sense based on how Unity actually works.",
